WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
We give people opportunities to learn by
doing, you know, so you

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:05.320
could get a young person that

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:09.140
may be into filmmaking, or that wants to
be a radio presenter, for

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.140
example, if they come

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:12.840
through, you know, rather than just giving
them loads of books, go

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.000
and read books, if you can

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.740
read a lot of books, books are good, I'm
not knocking it, but sometimes

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:17.880
when you practicalise

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.580
things, you learn a lot faster and you
make it on mistakes, I'm saying

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.800
so, we tend to

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:26.900
teach people by giving them practical
opportunities, so put someone

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:27.940
else to be a radio presenter,

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.000
You know, we'll go through a quick
training on the etiquette of radio

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.760
and what not, but

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.560
we'll just say, I quote, as a shadow
somebody for a couple of weeks

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.480
or what not to kind

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.500
of learn the ropes, and then we'll give
them their own radio show,

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.580
one hour radio show,

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.820
straight, you know, which I was more or
less, not straight away,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.900
but, you know, what's the

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.140
kind of done, the initial kind of, um,
watching somebody else for

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:48.260
a little bit, we'll give

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.600
them a chance just to get in there and
just get on with it.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:51.640
Radio's meant to be fun.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.320
It's meant to be, you know, young people
want to do things that are

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.180
fun, they want to

00:00:56.180 --> 00:00:59.360
talk about what they care about. So we
tried to empower them to do

00:00:59.360 --> 00:00:59.600
that.
